    "title": "City sees sharp reduction in turnover rate, HR director tells council - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lance Martin ,\n9 hours ago Roanoke Rapids Human Resources Director Christina Caudle gave the council some upbeat news about the city’s turnover rate on Tuesday. She said that in the first six months of the year, the city’s turnover rate is now at 5.26 percent. “We are doing a really, really great job there,” she said. “That’s not a human resources thing, that’s an everybody thing with recruitment and retention of our employees.” Read full article",
